meta {
  name: trip-finance
}

docs {
  Trip finance endpoints (ENG-1431): loading, unloading, shortage, salary and P&L per trip, truck expense
  settings, hire payments on market trips, driver payment summary and the v2 reports. Contract:
  `operations/tripfinance` in plutus-java. Staging, torg 315.

  Run `01-login-owner` and `02-login-manager` first; they keep the tokens in runtime vars. The requests are in
  journey order, and several depend on the ones before them (financials after unloading, the reverts after the
  payments). The same sequence, with its narrative, is the flow `bruno/flows/plutus-api/siva-trip-finance/`.
  Hire payments move no money; apply-to-same-gvw is dryRun only.
}
